{
  "title": "Tablor",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "2-osc wavetable",
        "synth. 8 voices",
        "poly or mono.",
        "",
        "2 wavetable oscs,",
        "sub, noise, multi-",
        "mode filter, two",
        "envelopes, 2 LFOs,",
        "4-slot mod matrix,",
        "8 user macros.",
        "",
        "Based on Wavetable",
        "by Roland Rabien",
        "(FigBug), BSD-3."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Wavetables",
      "lines": [
        "Tables live in",
        "UserLibrary/",
        " Wavetables.",
        "",
        "Drop .wav files",
        "there via Move",
        "Manager or the",
        "schwung manager.",
        "",
        "Serum, Vital and",
        "Ableton exports",
        "work. Any frame",
        "size: 2048, 512,",
        "256, 128, or one",
        "single cycle.",
        "",
        "Frame size is read",
        "from the file's",
        "own harmonics, so",
        "short tables play",
        "at the right pitch",
        "with no metadata.",
        "",
        "115 factory tables",
        "are seeded on",
        "first run.",
        "",
        "On the OSC page,",
        "turn knobs 1/2 to",
        "step tables, or",
        "click to browse",
        "with live preview."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pages",
      "lines": [
        "Stock Schwung UI:",
        "jog scrolls, click",
        "opens, Back goes",
        "up. Knobs 1-8 play",
        "the open page.",
        "",
        "Main: both tables,",
        " pos, level, tune",
        "Unison / Shape",
        "Filter: cutoff,",
        " res, type, sub,",
        " noise",
        "Env / Env+",
        "LFO 1 / LFO 2",
        "Mod 1-2 / 3-4",
        "Global",
        "User + U.Map:",
        " 8 macros",
        "Presets: last page"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "User Macros",
      "lines": [
        "8 knobs you map",
        "to anything.",
        "",
        "On U.MAP, pick a",
        "target for each",
        "macro. On USER,",
        "play them.",
        "",
        "Macros save with",
        "the patch and can",
        "be automated."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Presets",
      "lines": [
        "Presets is the",
        "last page: PRESET,",
        "SAVE, RENAME and",
        "RND PRST.",
        "",
        "PRESET: turn to",
        "step through every",
        "preset. Hold and",
        "click for the",
        "whole list.",
        "",
        "SAVE opens the",
        "keyboard. On a",
        "factory sound it",
        "is blank: type a",
        "name. On your own",
        "it is prefilled,",
        "so confirming",
        "overwrites it.",
        "",
        "RENAME renames the",
        "current preset.",
        "RND PRST loads a",
        "random one.",
        "",
        "Your sounds are",
        ".tblr files in",
        "UserLibrary/",
        " Tablor Presets -",
        "copy and share",
        "them freely.",
        "",
        "8 factory sounds",
        "ship built in."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "MIDI",
      "lines": [
        "Notes, velocity,",
        "pitch bend (range",
        "on GLOBAL page),",
        "mod wheel (CC 1),",
        "sustain (CC 64),",
        "aftertouch.",
        "",
        "Mod wheel, after-",
        "touch and pitch",
        "bend are also mod",
        "matrix sources."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Credits",
      "lines": [
        "Sound engine after",
        "Wavetable + gin by",
        "Roland Rabien",
        "(BSD-3).",
        "",
        "Filter DSP:",
        "AudioFilter (MZTi).",
        "FLAC: dr_flac.",
        "Pink noise: Thomas",
        "Merchant (MIT).",
        "",
        "Wavetables:",
        "Adventure Kid",
        "(AKWF, public",
        "domain) and Neu",
        "KatalYst (free).",
        "",
        "Port for Schwung:",
        "athousanddetails."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
